GEO:45.5231;-122.6375
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Alex Huston Fischer · 105 min\n\nOn the outskirts of a vi
 llage by the sea\, lives a Fisherwoman\; smelly\, single and perpetually r
 idiculed. One day\, fed up with her stuffy\, small-minded neighbours\, she
  commissions herself a husband to be made from wicker. In an otherwise con
 servative town\, this unconventional romance sparks outrage\, jealousy and
  chaos.\n\nTickets: https://3677.formovietickets.com:2235/T.ASP?WCI=bt&Pag
