  of a white woman and a Native American man in San Francisco's Chinatown t
 riggers a race against time as the Chinese suspect and the Native American
 's adopted Chinese son work to uncover the truth while a politician seeks 
 to leverage the Chinese Exclusion Bill as well as the prevailing xenophobi
 a and racism to close down Chinatown and elect himself as the mayor.\n\nTi
 ckets: https://morelandtheater.com/tickets/\n\nMore showtimes: https://mat
 tlohkamp.github.io/small-screens-pdx/
