LOCATION:Academy Theater\, 7818 SE Stark St\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5191;-122.5829
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Takashi Yamazaki · 135 min\n\nFormat: Subtitled\n\nWar re
 duced Japan to zero\, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have p
 assed since then\, and the country has faced agonizing struggles to achiev
 e recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to
  cling to a hard-won peace\, a new threat strikes\, crushing hope in an in
 stant. There is no third time. Everything ends here.\n\nTickets: https://b
 ooking.academytheaterpdx.com/launch/ticketing/bc8ff328-e6e4-59fc-9ec4-46f7
