SUMMARY:How to Lose a Guy in 10 Days (2003)
LOCATION:The Cinemagic Theater\, 2021 SE Hawthorne Blvd\, Portland OR
GEO:45.5122;-122.6366
DESCRIPTION:Dir. Donald Petrie · 116 min\n\nIt's the battle of wills\, as 
 Andie needs to prove she can dump a guy in 10 days\, whereas Ben needs to 
